<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 5.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 5.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Saturday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- Arafat on Friday briefed president on the Mideast Washington summit.</p>
<p>- President chairs on Saturday the Firm's Day. He is expected to address businessmen.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Arafat says after meeting president that Tunisia supports Palestine. Says PLO will never give up Palestinian rights.</p>
</text>
